---
title: How to Edit a Lead?
sidebar:
  order: 2
---
**You can update the details of any lead directly from your Taskip dashboard:**

1. **Go to Taskip > Leads.**
1. **Locate the lead you want to edit in the list.**
1. **Click the three-dot button under the Action column on the right of the lead.**
1. **Select Edit Lead from the dropdown menu.**

**5. Update the lead details, such as:**

- **Name**
- **Contact (Email/Phone)**
- **Lead Source**
- **Lead Owner**
- **Status**

**6. Click Save Changes to apply your updates.**
